{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"89380","name":"Loceanica Beach Resort","description":"Indulge in a pampering experience at the full-service spa, offering massages, body treatments, and facials. Take a refreshing dip in one of the two outdoor swimming pools or unwind on the private beach. This all-inclusive property offers a wide range of amenities, including concierge services, babysitting (surcharge), and gift shops. Rates include meals and beverages at onsite dining establishments, with some exceptions applying. Savor delicious seafood at Mavi Restaurant, one of the property's three restaurants, or enjoy 24-hour room service in the comfort of your room. Snacks are also available at the coffee shop/café. Join other guests at the complimentary daily reception. A beach bar, five bars/lounges, and two poolside bars offer a variety of refreshing drinks. The property also features a business center, express check-in, and dry cleaning/laundry services. For events, there are conference facilities measuring 2368 square feet (220 square meters). A roundtrip airport shuttle is available for a surcharge (24 hours), and free self-parking is provided onsite. Each of the 316 air-conditioned rooms provides a relaxing retreat, featuring free minibar items, an LCD television, and a private balcony with satellite TV. Private bathrooms are equipped with deep soaking bathtubs and complimentary toiletries. Nearby attractions include Blauhimmel beach (0. 2 mi), Daima (1 mi), and Alacasu (2. 9 mi).","address":"Çamyuva Mah. 5087 sok no 10/1 Kemer","city":"ANTALYA","countryCode":"TR","postalCode":"07980","lat":36.55964479,"lng":30.5698486,"stars":5,"giataCode":"90278","phone":"00902428247090","email":"info@loceanicahotel.com","website":"www.loceanicahotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/089380/089380a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/08/089380/089380a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"ext